hwlens was forked from btop++ v1.4.8 in November 2026. Since then the
source files have been renamed (btop_* -> hwlens_*) and modified; new
features include hwmon fan speeds and PWM duty, a reworked GPU box with
throttle reasons, disk temperatures, pressure stall information, hybrid
CPU (P/E core) awareness and per-process GPU memory and systemd unit
columns. Original copyright headers in the source files are retained.

Bundled third-party code keeps its own license, see the include/ directory
and src/linux/intel_gpu_top/.
